  "question": {
    "text": "The energy that should be added to an electron to reduce its de-Broglie wavelength from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>nm</mi></math> to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>nm</mi></math> is"
